<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's doubles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Monday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge (Australia)/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat</p>
<p>Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela)/Christo Van Rensburg (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia)/Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Jamie</p>
<p>Delgado (Britain)/Andrew Foster (Britain) 4-6 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat</p>
<p>Paul Kilderry (Australia)/Michael Tebbutt (Australia) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic)/David Rikl (Czech Republic) beat</p>
<p>Mark Keil (U.S.)/Jeff Salzenstein (U.S.) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Brent Haygarth (South Africa)/Greg Van Emburgh (U.S.) beat</p>
<p>Olivier Delaitre (France)/Guillaume Raoux (France) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>10-Sandon Stolle (Australia)/Cyril Suk (Czech Republic) beat</p>
<p>David Dilucia (U.S.)/Roger Smith (Bahamas) 6-0 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>12-Donald Johnson (U.S.)/Francisco Montana (U.S.) beat Pat Cash</p>
<p>(Australia)/Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 3-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>9-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden)/Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) beat Byron</p>
<p>Black (Zimbabwe)/Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>8-Rick Leach (U.S.)/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Kent Kinnear</p>
<p>(U.S.)/Aleksandar Kitinov (Macedonia) 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Jens Knippschild (Germany)/Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat 15-Grant</p>
<p>Connell (Canada)/Scott Davis (U.S.) 6-4 6-7 (5-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Bill Behrens (U.S.)/Chris Haggard (South Africa) beat Pablo</p>
<p>Albano (Argentina)/Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-4) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Sander Groen (Netherlands)/Sasa Hirszon (Croatia) beat Dave</p>
<p>Randall (U.S.)/Jack Waite (U.S.) 6-7 (7-9) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>11-Neil Broad (Britain)/Piet Norval (South Africa) beat</p>
<p>Cristian Brandi (Italy)/Filippo Messori (Italy) 7-6 (7-5) 6-1</p>
<p>Wayne Black (Zimbabwe)/Jim Grabb (U.S.) beat Emilio Sanchez</p>
<p>(Spain)/Fabrice Santoro (France) 7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
